  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukaia moyo kwa ndighi ra Roho Mweli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu idana, ndekuwadie kutanywa kungi kwa awo wiko andenyi ya Kristo Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ija Sharia ya Roho wa irangi jiko andenyi ya Kristo Jesu, yanibonyere nisekaie aisi ya sharia ya kaung'a na kifwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu agho ghiseredimikieghe kwa Sharia, kwa kukaia erekoghe isewadie ndighi kwa wundu ghwa mumbi, Mlungu kwa kumduma Mwana wake moni uko na fwana ya mumbi ghwa kaung'a, ukaie kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a, waitanyire kaung'a mumbinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu oobonya huwo, eri iro maza ra hachi rikundwagha ni Sharia, ripate kukatishwa andenyi kodu isi dawuyaghenda kwa Roho hata si kwa mumbi anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu awo wawuyakaia moyo wikighenjwa ni mumbi, wadaririkanya ra mumbi; ela awo wawuyakaia moyo wikighenjwa ni Roho, wadaririkanya ra Roho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kuririkanya ra mumbi ni kifwa, ela kuririkanya ra Roho ni irangi na sere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia mundu uririkanyagha ra mumbi ni m'maiza wa Mlungu; angu ndeusikiragha Sharia ya Mlungu, nao loli ndeudimagha kuisikira anduangi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na awo winughagha ra mumbi, ndewidimagha kumrira Mlungu anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela inyo ndemuwuenugha ra mumbi, mwaawuyanugha ra Roho; ikakaia loli Roho wa Mlungu wawuyakaia andenyi konyu. Ngera mndungi wasowa Roho wa Kristo andenyi kwake, ndeuko wake anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ngera Kristo oko andenyi konyu, hata ngera mimbi yenyu yafue kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a, ela Roho ni irangi angu mpatanishiro na Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikakaia Roho wa Mlungu uo oremrukishireghe Jesu kufuma kwa wafu wakaiagha andenyi konyu, uo Mlungu oremrukishireghe Kristo kufuma kwa wafu, uchaikaisha moyo mimbi yenyu ifwagha kwa chia ya Roho wake uo ukaiagha andenyi konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Wakor. 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu wanidu, deko na ilagho jebonya si kughenda seji mumbi ghukundagha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu mkakaia moyo mkighenda seji mumbi ghukundagha mchafwa; ela mkaghibwagha mabonyo gha mumbi kwa Roho, mchakaia moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu awo wose wighenjwagha ni Roho wa Mlungu niwo wana wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ndemorewusireghe Roho wa wuzumba sena um'bonyagha kuobua, ela morewusireghe Roho um'bonyagha kukaia wana wa Mlungu, udidimishagha kummbanga, “Abba! Aba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 14.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wagal. 4.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.5+GAL.4.6+GAL.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wagal. 4.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja Roho moni washuhudia andwamweri na roho redu kukaia deko wana wa Mlungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ikakaia diko wana, de wandu wa ifwa, wandu wa ifwa wa Mlungu, na wangara wa ifwa andwamweri na Kristo; ikakaia datirirwa andwamweri nao, eri diwonekaswa andwamweri nao wori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghuja wubaa ghuchagha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawona angu matiriro gha ngelo ihi ndeghidimagha kukatanishwa na ghuja wubaa ghuchaafunukulwa kodu anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu vilambo vose viumbilo vawesera kwa bea mbaa kuja kufunukulwa kwa wana wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ivo vilambo verewikiloghe vikaie visewadie ndighi ringi; si kwa kukunda kwawo koni anduangi, ela kwa kukunda kwa Mlungu, uo oreviwikieghe vikaie vesuwiriagha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.17+GEN.3.18+GEN.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 3.17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukaia, ivo vilambo veni vichafunywa andenyi ya wuzumba ghwa kuwoa, vipate wuhuru ghwa wubaa ghwa wana wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isi damanya angu vilambo vose viumbilo vasoria ngolo chiaimweri kwa kuwawa sa kukumba lufu kwa kuva hata idana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na si ivo vilambo viekeri anduangi, ela hata isi wori diko na mavalo gha imbiri gha uo Roho, dasoria ngolo andenyi kodu, dikiwesera kuja kubonywa kukaia wana wa Mlungu, nako niko kuja kukombolwa kwa mimbi yedu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.2+2CO.5.3+2CO.5.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Wakor. 5.2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu deekirwa kwa ijo isuwirio; ela isuwirio jiwonekagha si isuwirio jingi. Nani usuwiriagha icho wawuyachiwona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ngera dasuwiria icho disewuechiwona, dachiweseria kwa kurumaghia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
